<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harborside Healthcare.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harborside Healthcare.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Werheim &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Harborside Healthcare Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Harborside was down 1/4 to 13-3/4 at midday Wednesday.</p>
</text>
